# build.pypes -- A SYSTEM of two pype scripts, one edge per line.
#
#     the build log --> normalise.pype --> build.pype --> the comparison
#
# hwut runs it as the header of build.scm names it. By hand:
#     guile --no-auto-compile build.scm parallel | hwut.pype build.pypes
#     hwut.pype --draw build.pypes

--> normalise.pype
normalise.pype --> build.pype
